{"id": "EUVD-2026-90501", "enisaUuid": "e445f13a-49fe-3fcf-b382-bd68033c24c0", "description": "The Redux Framework plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to authorization bypass in all versions up to, and including, 4.5.14 This is due to the plugin not properly verifying that a user is authorized to perform an action. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with subscriber-level access and above, to delete arbitrary media library attachments, including administrator-owned files, from the affected site. This is exploitable by Subscribers when a Custom Fonts field is registered on the user profile page via Redux_Users::set_profile(), as doing so causes the required redux_custom_fonts nonce to be rendered into the Subscriber's wp-admin/profile.php page.", "datePublished": "2026-10-01T05:30:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-03T15:42:52", "baseScore": 4.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N", "references": ["https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/id/c7e24790-01a0-41bc-a380-60d86c6e1443?source=cve", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.13/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/custom_fonts/class-redux-custom-fonts.php#L57", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.13/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/class-redux-extension-custom-fonts.php#L338", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.13/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/class-redux-extension-custom-fonts.php#L392", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.13/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/class-redux-extension-custom-fonts.php#L617", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.14/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/class-redux-extension-custom-fonts.php#L571", "https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/redux-framework/tags/4.5.14/redux-core/inc/extensions/custom_fonts/class-redux-exten